        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Thin, casually dressed, mildly dishevelled; not in acute distress."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mood symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports feeling really hopeless and helpless, useless, and that nothing she tries makes a difference. Ongoing low mood, anhedonia, poor motivation, low energy, and poor concentration at work and home; feels guilty and like a burden. Describes mood as “hopeless, just over it.” Symptoms have been bad for ages and possibly worse over the last few weeks; timeline vague."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Sleep"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Broken sleep; stays up late on her phone and is sometimes awake until 4 a.m.; wakes unrefreshed."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Appetite and weight"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Appetite is erratic, sometimes eating nothing all day and then bingeing on junk food at night. Possible slight weight loss, unsure; no recent weight recorded in EMR."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Suicidal thoughts and self-harm"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Passive suicidal ideation: says it would not matter if she did not wake up. No active plan or intent today. Reports past superficial cutting, last more than 6 months ago; chart is similar. No recent self-harm disclosed. Identifies sister as support and says she would tell her or return if suicidal ideation worsened."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Psychotic symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies voices, paranoia, and thought interference; no delusions or hallucinations reported."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mental status examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reduced eye contact; fidgety and cooperative; vague historian with inconsistent dates. Speech normal rate and volume, slightly slowed. Affect constricted and congruent, intermittently tearful. Thought form linear and ruminative, with no formal thought disorder. Cognition grossly intact to person, place, and time, with patchy recent recall. Insight partial; acknowledges depression and impact of substances but minimises risk. Judgement questioned in relation to substances and work."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Substance use history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Drinks “a fair bit” after shifts: some nights minimal, other nights “heaps” and cannot remember going home. Previous AUDIT-C high risk in chart; no morning drinking. Intermittent cannabis to “chill” and occasional “party stuff” on weekends, likely cocaine/MDMA; last use approximately 1–2 weeks ago. Vapes nicotine daily."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-14",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Physical examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No focal neurological signs; chest clear; heart sounds dual. No signs of acute intoxication or withdrawal."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-15",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-15",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Suicide risk assessment"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Assessed as low–moderate today: passive suicidal ideation and multiple risk factors, but no plan or intent; supportive sister and willing to follow up. Does not meet criteria for involuntary admission."
      }
    },
